WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Tal vez necesitemos

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.640
to find a way to bring

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.040
your mom's soul

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.680
back into her body.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.480
Humbert,

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.040
this is not a movie.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.120
Her soul never left her body.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.560
Bite me.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:16.320
Hate me.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.360
You can never break me

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.320
because I'm here to help you.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.440
Criticize me, no problem, but

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.400
suggest something instead.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.040
Actually, I have one more idea.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.440
Yeah?

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:30.280
Damn me.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.880
That's Walt?

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.120
What?

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.360
Where?

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.600
Oh, what are you doing?

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.200
Hey.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.320
Give back. Give me that.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.320
Hey.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.520
Hey, prince.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.000
Miss Rose has condition.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.880
Hire best doctors

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.480
to save her mom.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.080
I can do this,

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:54.760
but there is a condition too.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.640
She has to be pregnant.
